# Drafted by Gemini (R21 prize), edited.

~ counter
Narrator: Painted shelves groan under mounds of dusty trinkets and tinny toys, while a smell of burnt sugar hangs thick round the stall.
chuckles [smile]: Step right up to the tip-top Prize Counter, hip-hip-heroes! Spend your shiny tickets on trinkets or your silly-billy friends!
* Buy a release slip for a friend -> slip
* Look at the prizes -> prizes
* Ask him what he wants -> ask
* Ask where to win tickets -> hint
* Leave -> END

~ ask
chuckles [sly]: Want? I want pies in every belly, bells on every toe, and fun-fun till your heels bleed!
interject name:silas_vane: Hear that rattle under the laugh, friend? That's the real stake showing through.
Narrator: For the span of a breath, the painted jaw goes slack, and a voice like grinding millstones rumbles down from the maypole overhead.
chuckles [angry]: I want you to despise me with every drop of marrow in your bones, and you will never know why.
-> counter

~ hint
chuckles [smile]: Seven merry-merry booths wait round the green, hip-hip-heroes! Smash the hives, ring the bell, answer the horsey knight, or tap the stork's drum!
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Seven rigged games and a loud barker, darlings, just like home on a wet Tuesday.
chuckles [sly]: Wrestle my big bear, drink with the chicken-house lady, or dance with the red-ribbon puppets! Win-win and bring your tickets back to me!
-> counter

~ prizes
chuckles [smile]: Feast your peepers on the shelfy-shelves! Everything has a price-price, and no backsies!
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 1 and not flag.prize_crow_taken] A plush angry crow, 1 ticket -> p_crow
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 1 and not flag.prize_sword_taken] A bloody-painted wooden sword, 1 ticket -> p_sword
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 1 and not flag.prize_shoes_taken] Crocodile-skin shoes, 1 ticket -> p_shoes
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 1 and not flag.prize_doll_taken] A porcelain doll in black lace, 1 ticket -> p_doll
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 1 and not flag.prize_glue_taken] A jar of glue, 1 ticket -> p_glue
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 1 and not flag.prize_shovel_taken] A child's shovel and pail, 1 ticket -> p_shovel
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 2 and not flag.prize_card_taken] A card from a Deck of Illusions, 2 tickets -> p_card
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 2 and not flag.prize_potion_taken] A greater Potion of Healing, 2 tickets -> p_potion
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 2 and not flag.prize_bag_taken] A rust-coloured Bag of Tricks, 2 tickets -> p_bag
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 3 and not flag.prize_suit_taken] The Revelry Suit, 3 tickets -> p_suit
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 3 and not flag.prize_paranormal_taken] A paranormal potion, 3 tickets -> p_paranormal
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 5 and not flag.prize_curio_taken] A cursed curio, 5 tickets -> p_curio
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 6 and not flag.prize_scroll_taken] A Spell Scroll of Resurrection, 6 tickets -> p_scroll
* Back -> counter

~ p_crow
chuckles [smile]: One stuffed scowler with button eyes, stitched up tight with grumpy-grump spite!
set fool_tickets -= 1
set prize_crow_taken
give plush_angry_crow
-> prizes

~ p_sword
chuckles [sly]: Red paint on pinewood, good for whacking play-pretend knights till the splinters fly!
set fool_tickets -= 1
set prize_sword_taken
give bloody_toy_sword
-> prizes

~ p_shoes
chuckles [smile]: Snappy-snap scales for your dainty toes, fresh off a swamp lizard that bit the cobbler!
set fool_tickets -= 1
set prize_shoes_taken
give crocodile_shoes
-> prizes

~ p_doll
chuckles [sly]: Pretty-pretty china in widow's weeds, and don't mind if her eyes follow you to bed!
set fool_tickets -= 1
set prize_doll_taken
give lace_porcelain_doll
-> prizes

~ p_glue
chuckles [smile]: Sticky-wicky clown paste that dries hard as coffin nails in ten short minutes!
set fool_tickets -= 1
set prize_glue_taken
give jar_of_clown_glue
-> prizes

~ p_shovel
chuckles [sly]: Diggy-dig in the dirt with a tin pail, just too small for burying anything that matters!
set fool_tickets -= 1
set prize_shovel_taken
give child_shovel_pail
-> prizes

~ p_card
chuckles [smile]: One lonely pasteboard from a trickster's deck, ready to spit out a paper phantom!
set fool_tickets -= 2
set prize_card_taken
give deck_of_illusions_card
-> prizes

~ p_potion
chuckles [sly]: Gulp-gulp the ruby syrup to patch your meat back together so the festy-val lasts longer!
set fool_tickets -= 2
set prize_potion_taken
give potion_of_healing_greater
-> prizes

~ p_bag
chuckles [smile]: Reach inside the fuzzy-wuzzy sack, though it only ever pulls out mean old billy goats!
set fool_tickets -= 2
set prize_bag_taken
give rust_bag_of_tricks
-> prizes

~ p_suit
chuckles [sly]: Motley hide stitched so fine it makes the wearer jig-jig-jig whether their bones want to or not!
set fool_tickets -= 3
set prize_suit_taken
give revelry_suit
-> prizes

~ p_paranormal
chuckles [smile]: A cold little bottle of bottled grief that tastes like grave-dirt and wet handkerchiefs!
set fool_tickets -= 3
set prize_paranormal_taken
give tincture_of_mourning
-> prizes

~ p_curio
approve cordelia_skein +2 delphine_ravelle +2 tobin_hayward -2: You traded hard-won tickets for an openly cursed carnival curio
chuckles [sly]: Oh, that nasty-wasty thing is properly cursed, and I will never-ever tell you what it does!
set fool_tickets -= 5
set prize_curio_taken
give cursed_curio_prize
-> prizes

~ p_scroll
chuckles [smile]: Six shiny tickets to drag a dead pal back for another round on the merry-go-round!
set fool_tickets -= 6
set prize_scroll_taken
give scroll_of_resurrection
-> prizes

# --- release slips (tools/content/build_fools_day_dialogue.py) ---
~ slip
chuckles [sly]: A release slip, for one friend, hee-hee. The price goes up every time. That is the whole joke.
if flag.revelers_bought == 0
-> slip_1
elif flag.revelers_bought == 1
-> slip_2
elif flag.revelers_bought == 2
-> slip_3
elif flag.revelers_bought == 3
-> slip_4
elif flag.revelers_bought == 4
-> slip_5
elif flag.revelers_bought == 5
-> slip_6
elif flag.revelers_bought == 6
-> slip_7
elif flag.revelers_bought == 7
-> slip_8
elif flag.revelers_bought == 8
-> slip_9
elif flag.revelers_bought == 9
-> slip_10
elif flag.revelers_bought == 10
-> slip_11
elif flag.revelers_bought == 11
-> slip_12
else
chuckles [weary]: Nothing left to sell, silly. You have all the friends there are.
-> counter
endif

~ slip_1
chuckles [sly]: Hee-hee, the very first one is only one ticket!
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 1] Pay 1 ticket for a slip -> buy_1
* Not now -> counter

~ buy_1
approve silas_vane +3 tobin_hayward +2 delphine_ravelle +2: You spent your festival tickets to buy a captive friend's freedom
set fool_tickets -= 1
set revelers_bought += 1
set release_slips += 1
chuckles [smile]: Hip-hip! Take it to your friend and wave it under their nose. They love that.
-> counter

~ slip_2
chuckles [sly]: Two tickets for the second, hip-hip, such a bargain!
* [if flag.fool_tickets >= 2] Pay 2 tickets for a slip -> buy_2
* Not now -> counter

~ buy_2
set fool_tickets -= 2
set revelers_bought += 1
set release_slips += 1
chuckles [smile]: Hip-hip! Take it to your friend and wave it under their nose. They love that.
-> counter

~ slip_3
